What is Travel Retail Cosmetics?
Travel retail cosmetics encompass personal care and beauty products specifically marketed and sold through duty-free channels including airports, cruise lines, border shops and other transit hubs. This specialized segment offers travelers exclusive access to skincare, fragrances, makeup and haircare products - often in travel-friendly formats or limited edition packaging that creates urgency for purchase. The global beauty industry was valued at approximately USD 427 billion in 2022, with skincare products accounting for USD 190 billion, perfumes USD 70 billion, color cosmetics USD 80 billion, and hair care products USD 90 billion.
